DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260908T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260908T203000
SUMMARY:Trivia at Trailhead (Novato) 
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\n🎉 Join Us for T
 rivia Night! 🧠☕️\nThis event is cross-posted with Sonoma Marin Brat
  Pack\, Marin County Millennials\, and North Bay 20s30s Meetup\, so RSVPs 
 may not reflect the full crowd.\n\nWe’re Team Quizzards! I’ll be at mo
 st events\, and if I can’t make it\, you’ll still find some friendly r
 egulars there. Look for us at the back of the coffee shop — come say hi 
 and join the fun! 🎉\n\n🕡 Trivia kicks off promptly at 6:30 PM\, so s
 wing by a bit earlier if you'd like to grab a drink or something tasty to 
 eat before we get started. I plan to be there at 6 pm to try to get us a g
 ood table .\n📍 Location:\nTrailhead Coffee\n127 San Marin Drive\, Novat
 o\, CA\nBring your friends\, your appetite\, and your A-game — see you t
 here! 🙌
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/316191872/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260820T013400Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260820T013400Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:North Bay Social Group
UID:event_316302825@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T180000
SUMMARY:Helen Putnam regional park hike
DESCRIPTION:North Bay's 20s and 30s social adventurers\ndetails at the bot
 tom\n\nJoin us for an invigorating hike amidst the natural splendor of Hel
 en Putnam Regional Park! Nestled in the heart of Sonoma County\, this hidd
 en gem offers scenic trails\, sweeping vistas\, and the tranquility of the
  great outdoors.\n\nOur hike will take us through lush forests\, rolling h
 ills\, and picturesque meadows\, providing ample opportunities to connect 
 with nature and enjoy panoramic views of the surrounding landscapes. Wheth
 er you're a seasoned hiker or just starting out\, this event welcomes part
 icipants of all skill levels.\n\nPlease wear comfortable hiking attire\, s
 turdy shoes\, and bring plenty of water to stay hydrated. Don't forget you
 r camera to capture the beauty of the park and the memories we'll create t
 ogether.\n\ndetails:\nWe will be starting our hike at the entrance on Oxfo
 rd Court. there is parking along the street that is free to park at. I hav
 e not picked out a trail in particular because I think it would be fun to 
 just explore the park and see where that takes us. I look forward to seein
 g you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-bay-social-group-20s-and-30s/ev
 ents/316302825/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260827T210828Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260827T210828Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
